   - Other topological indices: J_Dz(e), LOC, Psi_i_1d, Psi_i_A, SpPosA_B(p), nCIR.

3. Frequency/Presence of Specific Chemical Bonds or Groups:
   - Frequency of bonds at specific topological distances: F01[N-N], F04[C-N], F03[C-N], F03[C-O], F02[C-N].
   - Presence/absence of specific bonds: B01[C-Br], B03[C-Cl], B04[C-Br].

4. Electrochemical/Electronic Properties:
   - Sum of electronic states: SdssC, SdO.

5. Miscellaneous Molecular Features:
   - Specific chemical group counts: NssssC, C-026, N-073.

